{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48822","headline":"皇帝移晦日爲中和节 · 王季友","name":"皇帝移晦日爲中和节","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"皇心不向晦，改节号中和。\n淑气同风景，嘉名别咏歌。\n湔裙移旧俗，赐尺下新科。\n历象千年正，酺醵四海多。\n花随春令发，鸿度岁阳过。\n天地齐休庆，欢声欲荡波。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王季友","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48822.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48822","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}